ding, sending generic emails through recruiting software, or just seeking “exposure”...\n\nI focus on transforming driven high school football players into confident leaders, communicators, and businessmen…\n\nGiving them a step-by-step scholarship system to follow and enabling them to build relationships with college coaches, leading to scholarship offers.\n\nThe entire protocol for earning a scholarship, the college football business, leadership, and mental toughness, are all addressed.\n\nDo exactly what we say, and you can watch your son run out of the tunnel in front of 100,000 screaming fans, then post about it for the world to see.\n\nThis way, like my parents, you can prove all his haters wrong and laugh as you listen to other parents blame the portal and every other made-up excuse besides doing what actually works.\n\nClick the \"learn more\" button to see if it's the right fit.\n\n~ Richie Contartesi\n\nP.S. This is not a recruiting service, so if you don’t understand the value of mentorship, then please keep scrolling.","title":"Earn a College Football Scholarship 🏈","caption":"gonextplay.com","linkUrl":"https://gonextplay.com/application-ads","linkDescription":null,"callToAction":"Learn more","callToActionType":"LEARN_MORE","displayFormat":"VIDEO","images":[],"videos":[{"hdUrl":"https://video-bos5-1.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQN7NYoWhucAAVU15qlRgaRiQHblo5dorLRtkznt29quzw6YvYeg-LKHPmL5Jxl-HSuNB8-W-Wlnt7m8qvjVoduX3hmIvJzrh-qWlL7ffYQFrg.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_sid=b66105&_nc_ht=video-bos5-1.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=6ppslc2ICM0Q7kNvwFlViMy&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHAiLCJ4cHZfYXNzZXRfaWQiOjgzMDI4NjAzNjY2NjgxNiwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjMzMiwidmlfdXNlY2FzZV9pZCI6MTA3OTksImR1cmF0aW9uX3MiOjk5LCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=cbf0bb8ee73982a&_nc_&_nc_gid=OhCQXAk4Jx5TMYnIZqFTCg&_nc_ss=78180&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSak7z-X4StfUffx5vHfLn_6RxLR_HHN7yhPKjWSoFcDQ&oe=6AF3CB40"